  (descr "MX-style magnetic (Hall-effect) switch, e.g. Gateron Magnetic Jade / Akko magnetic, with a linear Hall sensor in SOT-23 directly under the stem magnet. Pinout 1 VCC, 2 VOUT, 3 GND (A110x / MT910xET / HAL9303SO compatible). Geometry after marbastlib SW_MX_HE_0deg_1u (CERN-OHL-P). Two NPTH for the housing pegs; switch is retained by a 1.5 mm plate.")
